			"Message": "style(Output): Capitalize Editor.Land domain in README links\n\nUpdate two documentation links in README.md to use the proper Editor.Land capitalization instead of lowercase editor.land. The domain editor.land is in grace-period hold while land.playform.cloud is the active telemetry domain.\n\nThis ensures consistency with the project's canonical domain branding across documentation.",
